### DocVault REST Client Requests
### Environment Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@authToken = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 1. Healthcheck
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### ==============================================================================
### 2. AUTHENTICATION (Owner)
### ==============================================================================

### Step 1: Request 6-digit OTP for Registration
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/send-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jordan@docvault.io"
}

### Step 2: Verify OTP and Register Account
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jordan Davis",
  "email": "jordan@docvault.io",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "otp": "123456"
}

### Login Owner (stores access token in @authToken variable)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@docvault.io",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Silent Refresh Token Rotation
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

### Get Current Authenticated Owner Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Logout Owner
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ==============================================================================
### 3. DOCUMENTS (Owner)
### ==============================================================================

### List Documents Owned by User
# @name listDocs
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

@sampleDocId = {{listDocs.response.body.documents[0].id}}

### Get Document Detail with Shares and Audit Logs
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{sampleDocId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Rename Document
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{sampleDocId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Renamed Q3 Financial Audit Report"
}

### Delete Document (Cascade Blacklists Active Shares)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{sampleDocId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ==============================================================================
### 4. SHARES (Owner)
### ==============================================================================

### Create New Share Grant (Signed Link)
# @name createShare
POST {{baseUrl}}/shares
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documentId": "{{sampleDocId}}",
  "recipientEmail": "auditor@deloitte.com",
  "permission": "view",
  "expiresInHours": 48,
  "maxViews": 5,
  "lockToFirstDevice": true,
  "note": "Strict compliance audit round"
}

@sampleShareId = {{createShare.response.body.share.id}}
@sampleShareToken = {{createShare.response.body.token}}

### List Shares Created by Owner
GET {{baseUrl}}/shares?status=active
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get Share Detail & Audit Timeline
GET {{baseUrl}}/shares/{{sampleShareId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Instant Revocation (Triggers Redis Blacklist)
POST {{baseUrl}}/shares/{{sampleShareId}}/revoke
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Immediate security withdrawal"
}

### Reset Device Lock
POST {{baseUrl}}/shares/{{sampleShareId}}/reset-lock
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Regenerate Link (Revokes Old Token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/shares/{{sampleShareId}}/regenerate-link
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ==============================================================================
### 5. RECIPIENT ACCESS (Public, No Login Required)
### ==============================================================================

### Recipient Opens Share Link (Consumes View, Enforces Device Lock, Issues Viewer Ticket)
# @name openShare
POST {{baseUrl}}/access/open
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "{{sampleShareToken}}"
}

@viewerTicket = {{openShare.response.body.viewerTicket}}

### Stream Document Bytes (Proxied through backend, Range Header supported)
GET {{baseUrl}}/access/stream?ticket={{viewerTicket}}

### Download Document (Blocked if View-Only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/access/download
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "{{sampleShareToken}}"
}

### Status Check Heartbeat (Viewer Polling)
POST {{baseUrl}}/access/verify-status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "{{sampleShareToken}}"
}

### ==============================================================================
### 6. AUDIT LEDGER (Owner)
### ==============================================================================

### List Audit Events with Filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit?page=1&limit=25
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Filter Audit by Action (e.g., access_denied_different_device, download_blocked)
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit?action=download_blocked
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Search Audit by IP or Recipient Email
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit?search=sarah.chen
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ==============================================================================
### 7. ANALYTICS (Owner)
### ==============================================================================

### Get Real Database Computed Analytics Summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
